{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-08-01 09:05:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK APPOINTS ALLYSUN FLEMING TO LEAD PAYMENTS STRATEGY IN NEW HEAD OF PAYMENTS ROLE', 'text': 'DALLAS, AUG. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) ANNOUNCED IT WILL ALIGN ALL PAYMENTS-RELATED OPERATIONS INTO ONE DIVISION DIRECTED BY ALLYSUN FLEMING WHO WILL SERVE AS THE NEW EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, PAYMENTS. FLEMING WILL REPORT TO PETER SEFZIK, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, COMMERCIAL BANK.'}